{"version":1,"content":"<p>大陸電視劇「逐玉」男主角張凌赫申請赴台灣被拒，大陸國台辦今天上午稱此舉「有損兩岸文化交流」。</p><p>台灣陸委會則回應，張凌赫多次貼文貶損台灣地位，對岸也曾刻意安排他在統戰平台「海峽論壇」演講，這次申請來台目的也不明確，全案不予核准。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:21:29.649575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:44:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:37.726094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:17:41.357471+00:00","content_hash":"bd8dc2b946d69d7360240971a819b5ce920c67e16a65a380d5a077e826c0131c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}